{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっかんべ―  ろっちぃー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/5899812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃ- と言われたり\nろてぃ-     と言われたり\nろてぃ子  と言われたり\nろてぃん  と言われたり\nろっちぃ- と言われたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どれもこれも\n可愛いニックネームを\n生み出してくれる\n周りの人々に感謝します(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12月なったとどー時に\n一気に めちゃめちゃ\n寒くなりましたねぇ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒さにびっくり(・〇・)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は\n『乃木どこ?』のとある収録を\nいっきに全部やってきました♪)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったよん(・ω・*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていてね♪/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとゆうことでっ,\n私は お風呂に行かなくてわっ //"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上っ ろっちぃーでしたっ☆))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/02/5899812/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のし。"}],"source":"archive"}